fine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a single, continuous course with multiple environments and new mechanics introduced along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints can be lost</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have a limited number of attempts (IE &quot;lives&quot;) to get to the next checkpoint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players revert to the previous checkpoint if all attempts are failed.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038100/extras/043015a452b82d13b41f738b053e48f8.poster.avif?t=1760884804\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038100/extras/043015a452b82d13b41f738b053e48f8.webm?t=1760884804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038100/extras/043015a452b82d13b41f738b053e48f8.mp4?t=1760884804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SETTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Barrel focuses on gameplay first and does not have an overt narrative, but there is some environmental storytelling.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Barrel Games are a seasonal event and tradition for this isolated, deepest-dwelling community of dwarves.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is essentially a telling of one of their dwarven folktales, in which two climbers of legend journey up through the strange, unruly, subterranean world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: The climbers' feet... it's like they're stepping up a ladder but it's a chain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: They pinch the chain with their toes.</p>","develop